# Testnet secret keys for this demo's two identities.
# AGENT_OPS_SECRET: a funded classic account (`stellar keys generate <alias>
#   --network testnet --fund`) — pays fees / submits transactions.
# AGENT_SIGNING_SECRET: a raw Ed25519 keypair registered as the smart
#   account's agent Signer::External pubkey (context rule 0).
# ADMIN_SIGNING_SECRET: a raw Ed25519 keypair registered as the smart
#   account's admin Signer::External pubkey (context rule 1) — this is what
#   authorizes update_mandate() calls. See scripts/deploy.md.
# Never commit real values here — this file only holds placeholders.
AGENT_OPS_SECRET=
AGENT_SIGNING_SECRET=
ADMIN_SIGNING_SECRET=
